{"type":"text","id":"note_body","x":100,"y":1012,"width":340,"height":80,"text":"原因：缺血缺氧·生物性·物理性·化学性及药物\n　　　免疫反应·遗传性·营养失衡·神经内分泌·社会心理\n机制：一个中心—缺血缺氧\n　　　两个结构—线粒体·细胞膜\n　　　三个物质—活性氧·钙离子·DNA/蛋白质","originalText":"原因：缺血缺氧·生物性·物理性·化学性及药物\n　　　免疫反应·遗传性·营养失衡·神经内分泌·社会心理\n机制：一个中心—缺血缺氧\n　　　两个结构—线粒体·细胞膜\n　　　三个物质—活性氧·钙离子·DNA/蛋白质","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":101074,"version":1,"versionNonce":201074,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":true,"index":"bP","frameId":null,"roundness":null,"updated":1789000000000,"hasTextLink":false,"rawText":""}
